<title>USA: Hunt Imaging completes Nashua deal.</title>
<headline>Hunt Imaging completes Nashua deal.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hunt Imaging LLC said Friday it had completed the purchase of Nashua Corp's assets related to the manufacture and marketing of Liquid Transfer Toner products worldwide.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Hunt, a manufacturer of dry and liquid electrostatic toners and a developer of imaging technologies, said the Nashua product line had been moved to Hunt's Berea, Ohio, manufacturing plant from Nashua, N.H.</p>
</text>
